<view class="zone-page">
  <view class="zone-header">
    <view class="zone-toolbar__title">项目编码管理</view>
    <view class="zone-toolbar__hint">
      领料时必须选择项目编码。改名后新领料会使用最新名称，历史领料记录保留当时的项目快照。
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ !loading && !loadError }}" class="project-count">共 {{ projects.length }} 个项目编码</view>
    <van-button type="primary" round block bind:click="onCreateProject">新建项目编码</van-button>
  </view>

  <view class="zone-hint">
    停用后，该项目编码不会出现在新的领料选择中；已有领料日志仍可按项目编码查询。
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{ loading }}" class="zone-loading">
    <van-loading type="spinner" vertical>加载中...</van-loading>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{ loadError }}" class="project-state">
    <view class="project-state__title">加载项目编码失败</view>
    <view class="project-state__text">{{ loadError }}</view>
    <van-button size="small" type="primary" plain round bind:click="onReloadProjects">重新加载</van-button>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{ projects.length === 0 }}" class="project-state">
    <view class="project-state__title">暂无项目编码</view>
    <view class="project-state__text">请确认云函数已部署或点击重新加载，系统会自动初始化默认项目编码。</view>
    <van-button size="small" type="primary" plain round bind:click="onReloadProjects">重新加载</van-button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="zone-list">
    <block wx:for="{{ projects }}" wx:key="project_code">
      <view class="zone-card {{ item.status === 'disabled' ? 'zone-card--disabled' : '' }}">
        <view class="zone-card__main">
          <view class="project-code">{{ item.project_code }}</view>
          <view class="zone-card__name">{{ item.project_name }}</view>
          <view class="zone-card__meta">
            <van-tag plain type="primary" wx:if="{{ item.is_builtin }}">默认</van-tag>
            <van-tag plain type="success" wx:else>自定义</van-tag>
            <van-tag plain color="#6b7280" wx:if="{{ item.status === 'disabled' }}">已停用</van-tag>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="zone-card__actions">
          <van-button size="mini" plain type="primary" bind:click="onRenameProject" data-index="{{ index }}">改名</van-button>
          <van-button size="mini" plain bind:click="onToggleProject" data-index="{{ index }}">
            {{ item.status === 'disabled' ? '启用' : '停用' }}
          </van-button>
          <van-button size="mini" plain bind:click="onMoveUp" data-index="{{ index }}" disabled="{{ index === 0 }}">上移</van-button>
          <van-button size="mini" plain bind:click="onMoveDown" data-index="{{ index }}" disabled="{{ index === projects.length - 1 }}">下移</van-button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <van-popup
    show="{{ projectFormVisible }}"
    position="bottom"
    round
    closeable
    bind:close="onCloseProjectForm"
  >
    <view class="project-form-panel">
      <view class="project-form-panel__title">
        {{ projectFormMode === 'create' ? '新建项目编码' : '修改项目名称' }}
      </view>
      <view class="project-form-panel__hint">
        项目编码用于领料归属统计，请按项目台账填写；项目名称会在领料选择和日志中展示。
      </view>

      <van-field
        label="项目编码"
        value="{{ projectForm.project_code }}"
        placeholder="OR2026RD99999"
        required
        readonly="{{ projectFormMode === 'rename' }}"
        input-align="left"
        bind:change="onProjectCodeInput"
      />
      <view class="project-form-panel__example">示例：OR2026RD99999</view>

      <van-field
        label="项目名称"
        value="{{ projectForm.project_name }}"
        placeholder="OR2026RD99-新增项目名称"
        required
        clearable
        input-align="left"
        bind:change="onProjectNameInput"
      />
      <view class="project-form-panel__example">示例：OR2026RD99-新增项目名称</view>

      <view class="project-form-panel__actions">
        <van-button plain round block bind:click="onCloseProjectForm" disabled="{{ formSubmitting }}">取消</van-button>
        <van-button type="primary" round block loading="{{ formSubmitting }}" bind:click="onSubmitProjectForm">
          {{ projectFormMode === 'create' ? '创建项目编码' : '保存项目名称' }}
        </van-button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </van-popup>
</view>
